@startuml PayLink_Payment_State_Diagram
title PayLink - Payment State Diagram (Section 2.5)

[*] --> INITIATED

INITIATED --> FUNDS_HELD : Fraud checks pass and\nwallet has enough funds
INITIATED --> REJECTED : Fraud check fails or\nfunds are insufficient

FUNDS_HELD --> SENT_TO_BILLER : Request sent to biller

SENT_TO_BILLER --> COMPLETED : Biller confirms
SENT_TO_BILLER --> FAILED : Biller refuses
SENT_TO_BILLER --> UNKNOWN : No answer within timeout

UNKNOWN --> COMPLETED : Biller later confirms\n(callback, retry or settlement file)
UNKNOWN --> FAILED : Biller later refuses or\nreconciliation finds no payment

FAILED --> REFUNDED : Hold released to the wallet

COMPLETED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
REFUNDED --> [*]

note right of UNKNOWN
  Money stays held.
  Never refunded automatically.
  Re-queried after 1, 5 and 15 minutes,
  then left to reconciliation.
end note

@enduml